---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import { SOCIAL } from '../consts';
---

<Base title="About" description="Who I am and why this blog exists.">
  <h1 class="rise">About</h1>
  <div class="prose">
    <p class="rise" style="--i: 1">
      Hi, I'm Teige, a software engineer in Philadelphia. I work across the full stack (React, Django,
      Python, PostgreSQL, AWS) and spend a lot of my free time starting projects: games, 3D prints,
      home-lab tooling, and whatever else catches my attention.
    </p>
    <p class="rise" style="--i: 2">
      This blog is where I write them up: what I was trying to do, the decisions I made, what broke,
      and what I'd do differently next time.
    </p>
    <p class="rise" style="--i: 3">
      You can find my code on <a href={SOCIAL.github}>GitHub</a> or connect with me on
      <a href={SOCIAL.linkedin}>LinkedIn</a>.
    </p>

    <h2 data-reveal>About this site</h2>
    <p data-reveal>
      Built with <a href="https://astro.build">Astro</a>. The <strong>Aa</strong> button in the header
      switches between three typefaces chosen for readability: Lexend, OpenDyslexic, and Atkinson
      Hyperlegible. Your choice is remembered. Animations are turned off automatically if your system
      is set to reduce motion.
    </p>
  </div>
</Base>
